config USART0_RS485
	bool "Enable RS-485 on USART0"
	default n
	---help---
		USART0 RS-485 function configuration. If the user configure the RS-485 on
		USART, the user should provide GPIO_USART0_RS485_DIR pin definition
		in board initialization.
		And it cannot be used with GD32E11X_USART0_RXDMA currently.

